B.bH=new A.a5(B.Eq,["Where Care Is Love","Egypt's registry for every pet","One record per microchip, opened at any member clinic with the owner's permission.","Owner sign in","Found a pet?","Enter the microchip number to notify the owner.","Emergency help","Quick first-aid guidance until you reach a vet.","Clinic portal","Register pets, record visits and vaccinations.","Care guide","Rabies, parvo, fleas, ticks, feeding, summer heat and more.","Everyday care for your pet","Simple tips that keep your pet healthy, from feeding to summer heat.","General guidance only. It does not replace your vet, who knows your pet. For danger signs, open Emergency help now.","Read the tips","Show less","Signs, treatment and prevention","Common diseases in Egypt","How to spot them, what to do and how to protect your pet.","Everyday care","Feeding, vaccines, heat, grooming and more.","Signs","Treatment","Prevention","Marketplace","Food, supplies and pets from verified sellers.","Coming soon","We're building this part now.","Microchip number","15 digits","The microchip number is 15 digits.","Search","The database is not connected yet.","No pet is registered with this number.","Registered pet","Reported lost","We will notify the owner. Their number stays private.","Something went wrong. Try again.","Go to a vet now if you see any of these signs. Do not wait.","Heavy bleeding that does not stop","Difficulty breathing or blue gums","Swallowed poison, medicine or chocolate","Seizures or collapse","Swollen, hard belly with retching (dogs)","Straining to urinate with nothing coming out (cats)","The assistant gives temporary first-aid advice only. It does not diagnose or prescribe.","The AI assistant will be connected in the next step.","Sign in","Email","Password","Sign in","Sign out","Wrong email or password.","Required","Registrations left","Subscription until","The subscription has ended. Renew it to keep using the portal.","This clinic is waiting for Pets4Pals to verify its documents.","Register a new pet","Open a pet's record","This account is not linked to a clinic.","Pet","Owner","Pet name","Species","Dog","Cat","Bird","Rabbit","Other","Breed","Sex","Male","Female","Unknown","Color","Date of birth","Owner name","Mobile","11 digits starting with 01","Email (optional)","Governorate","Register (uses 1 credit)","This microchip is already registered.","No registrations left. Contact Pets4Pals to top up.","Enter the microchip number. If this clinic can't see the pet yet, ask the owner for the code in their Pets4Pals app.","Owner's code","6 digits","Open","This clinic can't see this pet yet. Ask the owner for their code.","Wrong or expired code.","Visits","Vaccinations","Add visit","Add vaccination","No visits yet.","No vaccinations yet.","Reason for visit","Diagnosis","Treatment","Weight (kg)","Notes","Vaccine","Given on","Next dose","Save","Cancel","Saved.","Records can't be edited or deleted after saving.","Another clinic","My pets","No pets are linked to this account yet. Pets are registered at a member clinic.","Medical record","Give a clinic access","Code for the clinic","Give this code to the clinic with the microchip number. It works once, within 15 minutes.","Done","Report lost","Back home","Microchip","Pick a date","Visit date","Ask the AI assistant","Tell me what is happening: the type of pet, its age, and what you see. I will tell you what to do until you reach a vet.","Describe what is happening\u2026","Send","The assistant is writing\u2026","You have reached today's message limit. If this is urgent, go to a vet now.","The assistant is being set up. If this is urgent, go to a vet now.","The assistant could not reply. Try again, and go to a vet if it is urgent.","Go to a vet now","See a vet today","Watch at home for now","Pets4Pals member clinics","No member clinics are listed yet. Go to the nearest vet.","Call","Signs that need a vet right away","My dog keeps vomiting","My cat is not eating","My dog ate chocolate","A wound that is bleeding","New conversation","AI assistant \xb7 Plus plan","Instant first-aid guidance for your registered pets, any time of day. Available to owners on the Plus plan.","Your account is not on the Plus plan yet. Subscriptions open soon.","Sign in to use the assistant","\u0627\u0644\u0639\u0631\u0628\u064a\u0629"],t.w)
